OL,3,GNEWSAAll London minicabs could be
OL,4,Aelectric by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) has set out
OL,7,Fnew plans which aim to make all
OL,8,Fminicabs in London fully electric by
OL,9,F2030.
OL,11,FTfL says that currently 70% of all
OL,12,Fprivate-hire vehicles (PHVs) in the
OL,13,Fcapital are electric, and says
OL,14,Fincreasing this to 100% is a "vital
OL,15,Fcomponent" in creating a "healthier
OL,16,Fcity".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1792684585
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAll London minicabs could be
OL,4,Aelectric by 2030
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals aim for all newly
OL,7,Flicensed PHVs to be zero-emission from
OL,8,FJuly 2028, with the exception of those
OL,9,Fthat are wheelchair accessible, which
OL,10,Fwould need to be zero-emission from
OL,11,FJuly 2030.
OL,13,FSteve Wright, the chair of the Licensed
OL,14,FPrivate Hire Car Association (LPHCA),
OL,15,Fsaid he believed the aspirations were
OL,16,F"not achievable", with the cost of
OL,17,Fcharging a vehicle "extremely
OL,18,Fexpensive".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
